        <p>

          Peter's journey of compassion continued to grow through the
          Global Compassion Coalition Connectors Program, where meaningful
          friendships became opportunities to transform lives.

        </p>

        <p>

          One of those friendships was with
          <strong>Davina from Australia</strong>.

          Although separated by thousands of kilometres, they shared a common
          belief that every child deserves the opportunity to learn and build
          a better future.

        </p>

        <p>

          Through this partnership, together with other compassionate
          supporters, school fees were provided for
          <strong>41 vulnerable children</strong>, enabling them to remain in
          school and continue their education.

        </p>

        <p>

          For these children, education was more than attending classes.

          It represented hope.

          It represented opportunity.

          It represented a future.

        </p>

